; Changelly Exchange — built-in system add-on assets
; All paths below are relative to the extension's dist/ directory (webpack output)
; The extension is packed into browser.xhtml as a system add-on

[features/changelly-exchange@w3ai.io] (../../../browser/features/changelly-exchange@w3ai.io.xpi)
% content changelly-exchange %content/
  dist/manifest.json                              (../dist/manifest.json)
  dist/background/index.js                        (../dist/background/index.js)
  dist/popup.js                                   (../dist/popup.js)
  dist/popup/index.html                           (../dist/popup/index.html)
  dist/styles/globals.css                         (../dist/styles/globals.css)
